/data_assimilation.png\" alt=\"Satellite gravity project\">\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"ncsg-project-card-body\">\n      <p>\n        Here gives some descrition.\n      </p>\n    </div>\n  </a>\n  <a class=\"ncsg-project-card\" href=\"https://zenodo.org/\">\n    <div class=\"ncsg-project-card-header\">\n      <h3>FSC: An efficient filter for GRACE/GRACE-FO Level-2 products</h3>\n      <img src=\"../img/results/FSC_global.png\" alt=\"Satellite gravity project\">\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"ncsg-project-card-body\">\n      <p>\n        Here gives some descrition.\n      </p>\n    </div>\n  </a>\n</div>\n"},{"title":"NCSG group provides programs for satellite gravity computation.","math":true,"_content":"## Software\n\n{% include_md _meta/_software.overview.md %}","source":"software/index.md","raw":"---\ntitle: NCSG group provides programs for satellite gravity computation.\nmath: true\n---\n## Software\n\n{% include_md _meta/_software.overview.md %}","date":"2026-07-31T01:01:29.903Z","updated":"2026-07-31T01:01:29.903Z","path":"software/index.html","comments":1,"layout":"page","_id":"cuidGyB7EqbFXz4N3qF0ieAdU","content":"<h2 id=\"Software\">Software</h2>\n<div class=\"ncsg-project-grid ncsg-project-grid--list\">\n  <a class=\"ncsg-project-card\" href=\"https://github.com/NCSGgroup/PyHawk\">\n    <div class=\"ncsg-project-card-header\">\n      <h3>PyHawk</h3>\n      <img src=\"../img/projects/logo_pyhawk.webp\" alt=\"Satellite gravity project\">\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"ncsg-project-card-body\">\n      <p>\n        An efficient gravity recovery solver for low-low satellite-to-satellite tracking gravity missions.\n      </p>\n    </div>\n  </a>\n  <a class=\"ncsg-project-card\" href=\"/software/sagea/\">\n    <div class=\"ncsg-project-card-header\">\n      <h3>SaGEA</h3>\n      <img src=\"../img/projects/logo_sagea.webp\" alt=\"GRACE data processing project\">\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"ncsg-project-card-body\">\n      <p>\n        SaGEA is a Python toolbox for post-processing and error assessment of satellite gravity products.\n      </p>\n    </div>\n  </a>\n  <a class=\"ncsg-project-card\" href=\"https://github.com/NCSGgroup/SaGEA-fluid\">\n    <div class=\"ncsg-project-card-header\">\n      <h3>SaGEA-Fluid</h3>\n      <img src=\"../img/projects/logo_sagea_fluid.webp\" alt=\"Numerical computation project\">\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"ncsg-project-card-body\">\n      <p>\n        SAGEA-fluid extends SaGEA to include self-attraction and loading effects, geocenter motion, and Earth rotation effects.\n      </p>\n    </div>\n  </a>\n  <a class=\"ncsg-project-card\" href=\"https://github.com/NCSGgroup/PyGLDA\">\n    <div class=\"ncsg-project-card-header\">\n      <h3>PyGLDA</h3>\n      <img src=\"../img/projects/logo_pyglda.webp\" alt=\"Interactive visualization project\">\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"ncsg-project-card-body\">\n      <p>\n        PyGLDA is a Python platform for assimilating GRACE into hydrological model. \n      </p>\n    </div>\n  </a>\n</div>","excerpt":"","more":"<h2 id=\"Software\">Software</h2>\n<div class=\"ncsg-project-grid ncsg-project-grid--list\">\n  <a class=\"ncsg-project-card\" href=\"https://github.com/NCSGgroup/PyHawk\">\n    <div class=\"ncsg-project-card-header\">\n      <h3>PyHawk</h3>\n      <img src=\"../img/projects/logo_pyhawk.webp\" alt=\"Satellite gravity project\">\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"ncsg-project-card-body\">\n      <p>\n        An efficient gravity recovery solver for low-low satellite-to-satellite tracking gravity missions.\n      </p>\n    </div>\n  </a>\n  <a class=\"ncsg-project-card\" href=\"/software/sagea/\">\n    <div class=\"ncsg-project-card-header\">\n      <h3>SaGEA</h3>\n      <img src=\"../img/projects/logo_sagea.webp\" alt=\"GRACE data processing project\">\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"ncsg-project-card-body\">\n      <p>\n        SaGEA is a Python toolbox for post-processing and error assessment of satellite gravity products.\n      </p>\n    </div>\n  </a>\n  <a class=\"ncsg-project-card\" href=\"https://github.com/NCSGgroup/SaGEA-fluid\">\n    <div class=\"ncsg-project-card-header\">\n      <h3>SaGEA-Fluid</h3>\n      <img src=\"../img/projects/logo_sagea_fluid.webp\" alt=\"Numerical computation project\">\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"ncsg-project-card-body\">\n      <p>\n        SAGEA-fluid extends SaGEA to include self-attraction and loading effects, geocenter motion, and Earth rotation effects.\n      </p>\n    </div>\n  </a>\n  <a class=\"ncsg-project-card\" href=\"https://github.com/NCSGgroup/PyGLDA\">\n    <div class=\"ncsg-project-card-header\">\n      <h3>PyGLDA</h3>\n      <img src=\"../img/projects/logo_pyglda.webp\" alt=\"Interactive visualization project\">\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"ncsg-project-card-body\">\n      <p>\n        PyGLDA is a Python platform for assimilating GRACE into hydrological model. \n      </p>\n    </div>\n  </a>\n</div>"},{"title":"Developers","_content":"<link\n  rel=\"stylesheet\"\n  href=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/css/all.min.css\"\n/>\n\n\n<div style=\"display: flex; gap: 20px; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 30px;\">\n  <img src=\"/img/people/FanYang.webp\" width=\"140\" style=\"border-radius: 8px;\">\n  <div>\n    <h3>Dr. Fan Yang</h3>\n    <p><strong>Asisstant Professor</strong></p>\n    <p>Research interests: SPACE mission, satellite GEODESY, global WATER cycle and CLIMATE change.</p>\n    <p>\n      <a href=\"mailto:fany@plan.aau.dk\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-envelope\"></i> <u>fany@plan.aau.dk</u></a>\n    </p>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n\n<div style=\"display: flex; gap: 20px; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 30px;\">\n  <img src=\"/img/people/ShuhaoLiu.webp\" width=\"140\" style=\"border-radius: 8px;\">\n  <div>\n    <h3>Dr. Shuhao Liu</h3>\n    <p><strong>Postdoctoral researcher</strong></p>\n    <p>Research interests: gravity data processing, data assimilation</p>\n    <p>\n      <a href=\"mailto:liushuhao@apm.ac.cn\"><i 